Compat before-patch for b64-status-counter-repaired, applied to 23b8679ee (the parent of the lane
commit ea0c311cb that introduced the repaired behaviour; coordinator decision 3).

Production, one constructor only: RuntimeReconciler's lease-free Engine constructor, which
RuntimeReconcilerTest calls (5e4f4e698 deleted the lease). It delegates to this state's own Engine
constructor with a fresh RuntimeGpuLease, as ServicePhase builds it, so the reconciler behaves
exactly as this state does. No production code in this state calls it, and it supplies no status
counter behaviour.

